{"slug":"UPD-Ronaldo-Clicker!-Give-yourself-the-best-eggs-33934","_id":"67edca6b7bb36e6a4fb1483a","title":"Give yourself the best eggs","game":{"_id":"67e9db20f12b7676d0216af2","gameId":116713243588170,"name":"[🔥UPD] Ronaldo Clicker!","imageUrl":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-16384540233f600d1d9b01d2a34cae64/500/280/Image/Jpeg/noFilter","placeId":116713243588170},"features":"Really simple script that just gives you however many of the best pet you want\nShitty game likely many more scripts for it\nChange pet_amount to whatever you want\n\nYou can edit the script to give any pet in the game via dex and just editing it if ur bothered\n\nTested on swift","tags":["clicker"],"script":"local pet_amount = 10 --Change to whatever, this game has no trading though\n\nfunction random_number_string(n)\n    local t = {}\n    for i = 1, n do\n        t[i] = math.random(0, 9)\n    end\n    return table.concat(t, \"\")\nend\n\nlocal args = {\n    [1] = {\n        [1] = \"Pro Lebron\",\n        [2] = false,\n        [3] = \"Huge\",\n        [4] = \"\"\n    },\n    [2] = \"Pets\"\n}\n\nfunction give_pet()\n    args[1][4] = random_number_string(16)\n    game:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\"):WaitForChild(\"Events\"):WaitForChild(\"AddValueToTable\"):FireServer(unpack(args))\nend\n\nfor i=1, pet_amount do\n    give_pet()\n    task.wait()\nend","owner":{"_id":"67e29805a0d9b412a40b92b0","username":"gehehbrub","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/67e29805a0d9b412a40b92b0-1743649432612.jpg","status":"offline","id":"67e29805a0d9b412a40b92b0","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":5}},"verified":false,"views":3572,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-16384540233f600d1d9b01d2a34cae64/500/280/Image/Jpeg/noFilter","likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-04-02T23:38:19.142Z","discord":"https://discord.gg/getswift","editBy":{"_id":"67e29805a0d9b412a40b92b0","username":"gehehbrub","status":